## column_as_a_frame_definition_of_another_length (exit 1)
error[Z0217]: `frame` needs lists of one length: `a` has 2 values and `b` has 3
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:23
  |
2 | frame(a = [1, 2], b = w["id"])
  |           ------ 2 here
  |                       ^^^^^^^ 3 here
  |
  = help: give every column the same number of values; write `NA` for a value that is missing
